WEBVTT

00:01:28.470 --> 00:01:36.880 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.970 --> 00:01:39.950 line:0%
[Episode 18]

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:41.600 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen successfully sought justice

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:42.320 line:0%
for Jinxiu Workshop.

00:01:42.320 --> 00:01:43.200 line:0%
The real culprit has been brought to justice.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:44.529 line:0%
It's truly satisfying.

00:01:44.529 --> 00:01:45.720 line:0%
The wronged have been cleared.

00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:46.680 line:0%
This is really wonderful.

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:47.480 line:0%
The lady of the Shen's Mansion

00:01:47.480 --> 00:01:48.800 line:0%
will be me from now on.

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:50.460 line:0%
What are you still doing here?

00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:52.080 line:0%
Terrible news!

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:53.240 line:0%
The Grand Commander insists on reopening the old case.

00:01:53.240 --> 00:01:54.240 line:0%
It has displeased the Grand Empress Dowager.

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:55.559 line:0%
The entire Shen family is to be executed today.

00:01:55.559 --> 00:01:56.279 line:0%
Shen Du didn't

00:01:56.279 --> 00:01:57.320 line:0%
defy the Grand Empress Dowager.

00:01:57.320 --> 00:01:58.330 line:0%
Xing,

00:01:58.850 --> 00:01:59.840 line:0%
weren't you eager

00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:01.360 line:0%
to know the truth?

00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:02.240 line:0%
Yet now you feel sympathy

00:02:02.240 --> 00:02:03.900 line:0%
for Shen Du.

00:02:04.120 --> 00:02:05.000 line:0%
I don't.

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:06.200 line:0%
This isn't fair.

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:08.040 line:0%
There's no such thing as fairness.

00:02:08.040 --> 00:02:09.520 line:0%
Consider me, with my vast knowledge,

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:10.400 line:0%
yet because of my humble origins,

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:11.640 line:0%
I can't take the imperial examinations.

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:12.400 line:0%
The truth

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:14.200 line:0%
or ensuring Shen Du's safety,

00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:15.480 line:0%
you can only choose one.

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:16.340 line:0%
I won't choose.

00:02:16.400 --> 00:02:17.200 line:0%
I can't choose.

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:18.650 line:0%
Get out of here now.

00:02:18.720 --> 00:02:20.160 line:0%
Madam, please save the Grand Commander quickly.

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:20.960 line:0%
Think of something.

00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:21.800 line:0%
Xing.

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:23.120 line:0%
Hurry up and choose one.

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:24.760 line:0%
This place will be all mine from now on.

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:25.240 line:0%
Madam.

00:02:25.240 --> 00:02:26.480 line:0%
We're all going to be beheaded today.

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:26.920 line:0%
Madam.

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:28.480 line:0%
Don't you want to know the truth?

00:02:28.480 --> 00:02:29.360 line:0%
What are you standing there for?

00:02:29.360 --> 00:02:30.280 line:0%
I won't need

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:31.080 line:0%
to compete with you anymore.

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:31.760 line:0%
Madam.

00:02:43.660 --> 00:02:44.680 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:54.810 line:0%
Knock...

00:02:54.879 --> 00:02:56.400 line:0%
What on earth are you talking about?

00:02:56.400 --> 00:02:57.480 line:0%
Out...

00:02:57.480 --> 00:02:58.440 line:0%
A...

00:02:58.440 --> 00:02:58.840 line:0%
Bull.

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:00.900 line:0%
What do you mean by "Knock Out A Bull"?

00:03:06.690 --> 00:03:08.170 line:0%
Madam, you're finally awake.

00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:09.880 line:0%
The Grand Commander wishes to discuss something with you.

00:03:09.880 --> 00:03:11.940 line:0%
He has been waiting in the study for quite some time.

00:03:11.940 --> 00:03:12.740 line:0%
Xiaohe,

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:14.770 line:0%
what time is it now?

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:15.680 line:0%
Madam, you've been asleep

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:16.960 line:0%
until the hour of 6 pm.

00:03:17.080 --> 00:03:18.600 line:0%
The sun is about to set.

00:03:20.920 --> 00:03:21.800 line:0%
Could it be that

00:03:22.820 --> 00:03:24.879 line:0%
something is really about to happen?

00:03:42.730 --> 00:03:43.430 line:0%
Here.

00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:56.480 line:0%
I heard you wanted to see me.

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:56.570 line:0%
[Case File of Jinxiu Workshop]

00:03:56.629 --> 00:03:57.430 line:0%
[12 corpses of Ximing Temple]

00:03:58.080 --> 00:03:58.780 line:0%
Yes.

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:01.860 line:0%
Did something happen?

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:06.280 line:0%
These

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:08.000 line:0%
are the case files for the Jinxiu Workshop incident.

00:04:07.980 --> 00:04:09.090 line:0%
[Case File of Jinxiu Workshop]

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:09.600 line:0%
I've organized them.

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:11.400 line:0%
It'll be easier to review later.

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:16.889 line:0%
What do you mean?

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:18.920 line:0%
The Grand Empress Dowager has agreed

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:20.160 line:0%
to reopen the case.

00:04:20.180 --> 00:04:21.150 line:0%
Really?

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:23.840 line:0%
Do you think I'm

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:25.040 line:0%
joking with you?

00:04:26.640 --> 00:04:28.000 line:0%
Then you made me...

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:36.959 line:0%
Worry for nothing.

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:39.420 line:0%
I thought you would...

00:04:48.900 --> 00:04:50.610 line:0%
Were you worried I'd look out for myself only

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:51.750 line:0%
and close the case hastily?

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:53.880 line:0%
Or were you concerned I'd report this matter

00:04:53.880 --> 00:04:55.910 line:0%
and incur the Grand Empress Dowager's displeasure?

00:04:55.910 --> 00:04:57.780 line:0%
Is there a difference between the two?

00:04:57.780 --> 00:04:58.459 line:0%
There is.

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:01.090 line:0%
Which one were you?

00:05:02.810 --> 00:05:04.280 line:0%
Why do I have to make a choice

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:05.960 line:0%
after waking up?

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:09.180 line:0%
I won't choose.

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:15.320 line:0%
So?

00:05:16.840 --> 00:05:18.000 line:0%
What do you think?

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:23.410 line:0%
What... what can I think?

00:05:27.130 --> 00:05:29.130 line:0%
I think you're quite upright.

00:05:30.020 --> 00:05:31.640 line:0%
This is exactly what someone

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:33.640 line:0%
in an important position should do.

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:39.200 line:0%
Besides this,

00:05:40.730 --> 00:05:42.860 line:0%
is there anything else you want to say?

00:05:44.200 --> 00:05:45.300 line:0%
Say what?

00:05:50.820 --> 00:05:52.870 line:0%
Did I say something wrong again?

00:05:55.400 --> 00:05:56.200 line:0%
No.

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:21.000 line:0%
It's baffling.

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:44.800 line:0%
I heard that the Grand Commander at the court

00:06:44.820 --> 00:06:46.380 line:0%
engaged in a fierce debate with the scholars,

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:47.540 line:0%
showing no fear.

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:49.040 line:0%
With a passionate and inspiring

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:50.240 line:0%
speech,

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:51.890 line:0%
he convinced the Grand Empress Dowager

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:54.480 line:0%
to agree to reopen the Jinxiu Workshop case.

00:06:55.690 --> 00:06:56.770 line:0%
I suppose

00:06:56.959 --> 00:06:57.959 line:0%
you must have been

00:06:57.959 --> 00:06:59.560 line:0%
behind the scenes, offering advice and strategies.

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:01.700 line:0%
Your contribution is significant, isn't it?

00:07:01.700 --> 00:07:03.810 line:0%
I don't have any merit.

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:05.960 line:0%
Instead, I fell victim to Pan Chi's drug

00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:07.820 line:0%
and ended up knocking myself out.

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:08.720 line:0%
After I woke up,

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:10.160 line:0%
I heard this news.

00:07:14.400 --> 00:07:15.480 line:0%
Has investigating this case

00:07:15.480 --> 00:07:17.200 line:0%
made you stupid?

00:07:24.680 --> 00:07:26.000 line:0%
It's such a pity.

00:07:26.000 --> 00:07:27.180 line:0%
I've only heard about it,

00:07:27.180 --> 00:07:28.000 line:0%
but haven't been able to witness

00:07:28.000 --> 00:07:29.560 line:0%
the Grand Commander's impressive demeanor.

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:30.240 line:0%
Him?

00:07:31.360 --> 00:07:32.680 line:0%
He actually spends all day

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:34.350 line:0%
showing off his authority to me.

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:36.630 line:0%
You don't know how lucky you are.

00:07:36.650 --> 00:07:38.680 line:0%
The Grand Commander holds an important position,

00:07:38.680 --> 00:07:40.240 line:0%
and has a formidable reputation.

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:42.880 line:0%
Most importantly, he's good-looking too.

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:48.280 line:0%
He has a cold expression on his face all day,

00:07:49.730 --> 00:07:50.990 line:0%
it's so unattractive.

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:03.170 line:0%
Jing Lin.

00:08:03.740 --> 00:08:05.000 line:0%
Yes, Grand Commander.

00:08:06.720 --> 00:08:07.520 line:0%
Am I

00:08:10.610 --> 00:08:11.680 line:0%
unattractive?

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:33.280 line:0%
Miss Yun Que.

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:34.880 line:0%
I have something to tell you.

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:42.880 line:0%
I advise you not to

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:44.520 line:0%
provoke the Grand Commander right now.

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:45.840 line:0%
Mind your own business.

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:46.800 line:0%
Haven't you considered why

00:08:46.800 --> 00:08:48.660 line:0%
the Grand Commander is called...

00:08:49.480 --> 00:08:50.280 line:0%
White Ghost?

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:53.000 line:0%
I'm different from outsiders.

00:08:53.080 --> 00:08:53.760 line:0%
Just now, the Grand Commander

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:55.280 line:0%
even changed his expression.

00:08:55.280 --> 00:08:56.680 line:0%
If you still persist,

00:08:56.800 --> 00:08:57.560 line:0%
in case he gets angry,

00:08:57.560 --> 00:08:59.080 line:0%
he might twist your head off.

00:08:59.080 --> 00:09:00.480 line:0%
It's not impossible.

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:03.230 line:0%
Who are you trying to scare?

00:09:04.200 --> 00:09:05.400 line:0%
If you don't believe me,

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:06.400 line:0%
go ahead and try.

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:12.320 line:0%
I'm just curious

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:13.980 line:0%
about the Jinxiu Workshop case.

00:09:13.980 --> 00:09:15.040 line:0%
Brother Jing Lin,

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:15.840 line:0%
you often

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:17.480 line:0%
work on cases with the Grand Commander.

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:19.600 line:0%
Ji Fangming has already been interrogated,

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:21.600 line:0%
but regarding the Jinxiu Workshop incident,

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:22.800 line:0%
who was the original instigator

00:09:22.800 --> 00:09:23.980 line:0%
back then?

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:26.680 line:0%
You must know some inside information, right?

00:09:26.720 --> 00:09:27.520 line:0%
I...

00:09:29.760 --> 00:09:30.780 line:0%
I don't know.

00:09:30.810 --> 00:09:32.040 line:0%
You definitely know.

00:09:32.040 --> 00:09:33.160 line:0%
Tell me about it.

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:35.620 line:0%
Then let me ask you,

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:37.760 line:0%
what kind of relationship does your family have

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:39.320 line:0%
with Kong Xianrong from Jinxiu Workshop

00:09:39.320 --> 00:09:40.240 line:0%
that makes you work so hard

00:09:40.240 --> 00:09:42.040 line:0%
to reverse the verdict for his case?

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:43.600 line:0%
Even if I tell you, you won't understand.

00:09:43.600 --> 00:09:44.200 line:0%
If you don't explain clearly,

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:45.730 line:0%
how can others understand?

00:09:47.290 --> 00:09:48.570 line:0%
What do you mean?

00:09:48.680 --> 00:09:49.960 line:0%
Your family had frequent dealings

00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:50.840 line:0%
with Jinxiu Workshop back then,

00:09:50.840 --> 00:09:52.380 line:0%
yet was never affected.

00:09:53.440 --> 00:09:54.240 line:0%
Why is that?

00:09:56.540 --> 00:09:58.380 line:0%
Are you interrogating me now?

00:09:58.760 --> 00:09:59.560 line:0%
Could it be

00:09:59.560 --> 00:10:00.840 line:0%
you suspect my family?

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:03.200 line:0%
I...

00:10:12.340 --> 00:10:13.180 line:0%
[Princess Ying's Mansion]

00:10:15.060 --> 00:10:16.200 line:0%
Have you heard?

00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:16.920 line:0%
Hundreds of moths

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:18.320 line:0%
swarmed into the Princess Ying's Mansion.

00:10:18.320 --> 00:10:19.600 line:0%
It's terrifying.

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:20.280 line:0%
I heard

00:10:20.280 --> 00:10:21.360 line:0%
they flew over

00:10:21.360 --> 00:10:22.080 line:0%
from Jinxiu Workshop.

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:23.400 line:0%
They say it's the souls of those who died unjustly,

00:10:23.400 --> 00:10:24.200 line:0%
crying out

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:25.400 line:0%
and demanding justice.

00:10:25.400 --> 00:10:26.640 line:0%
Could it be that the Princess Ying is

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:27.800 line:0%
the mastermind behind

00:10:27.800 --> 00:10:28.600 line:0%
the Jinxiu Workshop massacre?

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:29.640 line:0%
Back then, she was

00:10:29.640 --> 00:10:30.640 line:0%
at odds with Princess Runing,

00:10:30.640 --> 00:10:31.800 line:0%
wasn't she?

00:10:51.120 --> 00:10:51.920 line:0%
Aunt,

00:10:52.490 --> 00:10:53.880 line:0%
regarding the Jinxiu Workshop case,

00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:55.760 line:0%
Mother Empress has agreed to reopen the investigation.

00:10:55.760 --> 00:10:57.640 line:0%
The injustice you've carried for years

00:10:57.640 --> 00:10:59.440 line:0%
can finally be redressed.

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:01.190 line:0%
The old case can be overturned,

00:11:03.630 --> 00:11:05.160 line:0%
but those who died unjustly

00:11:06.070 --> 00:11:07.990 line:0%
can never be brought back.

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:10.480 line:0%
Aunt, you still harbor hatred in your heart?

00:11:14.090 --> 00:11:16.690 line:0%
The fact that I can open the door to see you today

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:18.830 line:0%
means that I have put

00:11:18.920 --> 00:11:20.120 line:0%
the past behind me.

00:11:21.640 --> 00:11:23.170 line:0%
The dead are gone,

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:26.200 line:0%
and the living

00:11:26.590 --> 00:11:28.270 line:0%
must continue to live well.

00:11:29.850 --> 00:11:31.580 line:0%
Now everyone outside is saying

00:11:32.050 --> 00:11:34.020 line:0%
that the unjust case of Jinxiu Workshop back then

00:11:34.020 --> 00:11:35.420 line:0%
was my doing.

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:38.170 line:0%
That I caused the death of Aunt's prince consort.

00:11:38.270 --> 00:11:39.440 line:0%
Don't you have anything

00:11:39.440 --> 00:11:40.560 line:0%
you want to ask me?

00:11:43.400 --> 00:11:44.390 line:0%
So?

00:11:45.780 --> 00:11:47.480 line:0%
I didn't do it.

00:11:47.500 --> 00:11:48.780 line:0%
If that's the case,

00:11:49.440 --> 00:11:51.300 line:0%
why is your heart troubled again?

00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:54.040 line:0%
That invisible force

00:11:54.040 --> 00:11:55.170 line:0%
has appeared again.

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:57.260 line:0%
It's targeting the royal family,

00:11:57.830 --> 00:11:58.760 line:0%
trying to throw us

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:00.160 line:0%
into chaos.

00:12:03.880 --> 00:12:05.410 line:0%
I'm not the first one,

00:12:08.920 --> 00:12:10.720 line:0%
and you won't be the last.

00:12:14.110 --> 00:12:16.110 line:0%
Knowing there's nothing to be done,

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:19.510 line:0%
it's better to accept it as fate.

00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:22.880 line:0%
I refuse to accept that fate.

00:12:23.490 --> 00:12:25.330 line:0%
Be it the wrongful case of Jinxiu Workshop,

00:12:25.330 --> 00:12:27.080 line:0%
or the unsolved case of Chen Huo'e,

00:12:27.080 --> 00:12:27.980 line:0%
the Imperial Security Bureau,

00:12:27.980 --> 00:12:28.970 line:0%
the Imperial Investigation Department,

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:30.440 line:0%
the Court of Judicial Review, the Ministry of Justice,

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:32.700 line:0%
they're all trying to solve these cases.

00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:34.970 line:0%
We must bring

00:12:35.040 --> 00:12:36.580 line:0%
the truth to light.

00:12:38.610 --> 00:12:40.610 line:0%
The mortal world is full of turmoil.

00:12:41.550 --> 00:12:43.480 line:0%
I only seek clarity in my own heart.

00:12:44.640 --> 00:12:45.740 line:0%
Don't tell me

00:12:46.440 --> 00:12:47.840 line:0%
you want to stay in this Mingsheng Temple

00:12:47.840 --> 00:12:49.570 line:0%
for the rest of your life, Aunt?

00:12:56.030 --> 00:12:57.450 line:0%
The affairs of the world

00:12:58.530 --> 00:12:59.930 line:0%
are nothing but trifles.

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:00.920 line:0%
Here,

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:04.090 line:0%
at least, I can find some peace and quiet.

00:13:04.920 --> 00:13:05.720 line:0%
Forget it.

00:13:06.770 --> 00:13:08.400 line:0%
I brought this upon myself.

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:10.560 line:0%
You're still the same as before.

00:13:10.880 --> 00:13:12.840 line:0%
I can't stand this air of superiority.

00:13:12.840 --> 00:13:14.700 line:0%
You despise my frivolous nature.

00:13:15.720 --> 00:13:17.650 line:0%
I heard that when Prince Xian came,

00:13:18.380 --> 00:13:20.520 line:0%
you once divined for him.

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:22.010 line:0%
Today,

00:13:22.030 --> 00:13:24.130 line:0%
could you draw a fortune stick for me?

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:26.660 line:0%
I have been practicing here

00:13:26.880 --> 00:13:28.390 line:0%
for just a few years.

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:31.920 line:0%
My spiritual attainment is not profound.

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:33.400 line:0%
When it comes to interpreting fortunes,

00:13:33.400 --> 00:13:34.860 line:0%
I'm not very adept either.

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:37.260 line:0%
If there's nothing else,

00:13:37.970 --> 00:13:39.440 line:0%
you should head back early.

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:42.170 line:0%
This is clearly a polite way of asking me to leave.

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:43.510 line:0%
I know my place.

00:13:50.770 --> 00:13:52.810 line:0%
Our meeting is already a blessing.

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:55.350 line:0%
Why worry unnecessarily?

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:01.060 line:0%
Your Highness.

00:14:02.350 --> 00:14:03.380 line:0%
Shen Du?

00:14:04.680 --> 00:14:06.240 line:0%
Your Highness visits Mingsheng Temple at night.

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:07.520 line:0%
Are you concerned about Chen Huo'e

00:14:07.520 --> 00:14:09.520 line:0%
and the matters of Jinxiu Workshop?

00:14:09.520 --> 00:14:10.320 line:0%
What?

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:13.240 line:0%
Don't tell me even you suspect me.

00:14:13.240 --> 00:14:14.700 line:0%
Do you want to question me?

00:14:14.840 --> 00:14:16.640 line:0%
Your Highness misunderstands.

00:14:16.840 --> 00:14:17.800 line:0%
I have a plan.

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:19.520 line:0%
It can help Your Highness

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:21.060 line:0%
avoid false accusations.

00:14:28.320 --> 00:14:29.080 line:0%
Come on, come on.

00:14:29.080 --> 00:14:30.560 line:0%
Bring them in, bring them in.

00:14:30.560 --> 00:14:32.420 line:0%
Alright, alright, put them here.

00:14:44.650 --> 00:14:46.950 line:0%
Master!

00:14:47.900 --> 00:14:48.880 line:0%
-Father.
-Que.

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:49.760 line:0%
-Mother.
-Que.

00:14:49.760 --> 00:14:50.860 line:0%
How did you get here?

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:52.100 line:0%
Yes, it was this...

00:14:53.270 --> 00:14:54.310 line:0%
Young hero.

00:14:54.340 --> 00:14:55.660 line:0%
He tied us up...

00:14:57.840 --> 00:14:59.520 line:0%
He escorted us all the way here.

00:14:59.520 --> 00:15:00.510 line:0%
He escorted us.

00:15:03.760 --> 00:15:05.280 line:0%
How did you manage that?

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:08.470 line:0%
Anyway, I've brought them to you.

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:12.590 line:0%
He also said

00:15:12.690 --> 00:15:15.570 line:0%
that Que is to marry Shen Du,

00:15:15.590 --> 00:15:17.050 line:0%
the Grand Commander Shen.

00:15:20.550 --> 00:15:21.620 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:15:21.970 --> 00:15:23.080 line:0%
if you had such intentions,

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:24.600 line:0%
you could have just told me.

00:15:24.600 --> 00:15:26.330 line:0%
Why bother with this surprise?

00:15:26.560 --> 00:15:27.360 line:0%
Yan Xing.

00:15:29.310 --> 00:15:30.190 line:0%
This matter,

00:15:31.440 --> 00:15:32.320 line:0%
you handle it.

00:15:39.170 --> 00:15:41.660 line:0%
[Prudence and Reverence]

00:15:39.300 --> 00:15:40.280 line:0%
Uncle, Aunt,

00:15:40.280 --> 00:15:42.120 line:0%
you've traveled all the way to Xiang'an,

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:42.840 line:0%
I'm sure on the journey

00:15:42.840 --> 00:15:44.520 line:0%
you haven't had a chance to rest properly.

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:46.000 line:0%
Why don't we take a break first?

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:47.360 line:0%
We can discuss this matter later

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:48.320 line:0%
and make plans then.

00:15:48.320 --> 00:15:49.190 line:0%
Sir and Madam,

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:51.040 line:0%
please rest in the main hall.

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:58.030 line:0%
[Prudence and Reverence]

00:15:59.320 --> 00:16:01.210 line:0%
Is this how you invite people?

00:16:01.400 --> 00:16:03.400 line:0%
You didn't specify how to bring them here.

00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:05.420 line:0%
Besides, they weren't cooperating.

00:16:05.420 --> 00:16:06.380 line:0%
Moreover,

00:16:06.700 --> 00:16:08.830 line:0%
this way is the safest for them to come.

00:16:10.440 --> 00:16:11.240 line:0%
Oh, right,

00:16:12.200 --> 00:16:13.660 line:0%
I found out something else

00:16:13.880 --> 00:16:15.680 line:0%
that you might be interested in.

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:29.690 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen, please.

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:46.110 line:0%
[Noble Aspiration] [Gentle and Humble]

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:45.060 line:0%
Yun Que isn't here,

00:16:45.360 --> 00:16:47.290 line:0%
so let's get straight to the point.

00:16:48.840 --> 00:16:49.800 line:0%
Uncle, Aunt,

00:16:50.000 --> 00:16:51.720 line:0%
the reason we invited you to Xiang'an

00:16:51.720 --> 00:16:53.640 line:0%
is not about Yun Que's marriage.

00:16:54.680 --> 00:16:55.440 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen

00:16:55.440 --> 00:16:57.220 line:0%
has been sheltering Yun Que in his residence,

00:16:57.220 --> 00:16:58.160 line:0%
but has never had

00:16:58.160 --> 00:16:59.890 line:0%
any intention of marrying her.

00:17:02.280 --> 00:17:04.080 line:0%
Regarding the incident at Jinxiu Workshop years ago,

00:17:04.080 --> 00:17:05.360 line:0%
we hope that this time

00:17:05.680 --> 00:17:07.280 line:0%
you can tell us the truth.

00:17:09.240 --> 00:17:11.210 line:0%
What do you mean by this, Madam?

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:12.639 line:0%
We don't understand.

00:17:13.720 --> 00:17:14.960 line:0%
Your journey to Xiang'an

00:17:14.960 --> 00:17:15.909 line:0%
hasn't been peaceful.

00:17:15.590 --> 00:17:19.310 line:0%
[Noble Aspiration] [Gentle and Humble]

00:17:16.110 --> 00:17:18.200 line:0%
I don't need to mention those assassins,

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:19.930 line:0%
you must have heard about them.

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:21.930 line:0%
At this point,

00:17:22.040 --> 00:17:23.899 line:0%
if you continue to hide the truth,

00:17:23.909 --> 00:17:25.520 line:0%
I'm afraid Grand Commander Shen

00:17:25.520 --> 00:17:27.919 line:0%
won't be able to protect you indefinitely.

00:17:34.550 --> 00:17:35.550 line:0%
That's true.

00:17:36.790 --> 00:17:38.120 line:0%
Indeed, my household has no obligation

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:39.850 line:0%
to shelter irrelevant people.

00:17:46.200 --> 00:17:47.000 line:0%
Honey.

00:17:47.020 --> 00:17:49.040 line:0%
Since they are unwilling to say more,

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:49.920 line:0%
then we

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:51.780 line:0%
don't need to waste any more time.

00:17:52.310 --> 00:17:54.120 line:0%
I've heard that near Jinxiu Workshop,

00:17:53.870 --> 00:17:55.430 line:0%
[Noble Aspiration] [Gentle and Humble]

00:17:54.180 --> 00:17:56.550 line:0%
there have been restless spirits haunting us lately.

00:17:56.550 --> 00:17:57.980 line:0%
I am of a timid nature,

00:17:58.120 --> 00:18:00.120 line:0%
and I'd rather not invite more trouble.

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:00.920 line:0%
Why don't we

00:18:00.920 --> 00:18:02.720 line:0%
pack up their belongings

00:18:02.890 --> 00:18:04.920 line:0%
and ask them to leave the Shen's Mansion under the cover of darkness?

00:18:04.920 --> 00:18:06.440 line:0%
Whether they live or die,

00:18:08.810 --> 00:18:10.270 line:0%
let it be their own fate.

00:18:11.760 --> 00:18:12.560 line:0%
Very well.

00:18:14.550 --> 00:18:15.660 line:0%
-Wait.
-Honey.

00:18:20.620 --> 00:18:22.100 line:0%
Que is innocent.

00:18:24.460 --> 00:18:25.380 line:0%
Uncle Yun,

00:18:26.000 --> 00:18:27.080 line:0%
we don't want

00:18:27.100 --> 00:18:28.650 line:0%
to see you in danger either.

00:18:28.880 --> 00:18:29.720 line:0%
But now,

00:18:29.800 --> 00:18:31.080 line:0%
someone is using the old Jinxiu Workshop case

00:18:31.080 --> 00:18:32.300 line:0%
to stir up trouble again.

00:18:32.300 --> 00:18:34.160 line:0%
Even if you conceal what you know,

00:18:34.600 --> 00:18:36.080 line:0%
do you really think the instigator

00:18:36.080 --> 00:18:37.880 line:0%
will protect you completely?

00:18:38.400 --> 00:18:40.310 line:0%
We've wronged Jinxiu Workshop.

00:18:40.440 --> 00:18:42.150 line:0%
We've wronged Boss Kong.

00:18:42.320 --> 00:18:43.120 line:0%
But

00:18:43.270 --> 00:18:45.160 line:0%
we were also forced by circumstances.

00:18:45.160 --> 00:18:45.800 line:0%
If we

00:18:45.800 --> 00:18:47.560 line:0%
had meddled in affairs that didn't concern us,

00:18:47.560 --> 00:18:49.190 line:0%
our entire Yun clan

00:18:49.220 --> 00:18:51.130 line:0%
wouldn't have survived.

00:18:51.550 --> 00:18:53.750 line:0%
When we checked the evidence back then,

00:18:54.340 --> 00:18:56.080 line:0%
we did find something unusual.

00:18:56.110 --> 00:18:58.320 line:0%
We thought about contacting Boss Kong immediately,

00:18:58.320 --> 00:18:59.450 line:0%
but that very night,

00:18:59.700 --> 00:19:00.900 line:0%
we were threatened.

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:02.160 line:0%
They wanted us to keep quiet,

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:02.960 line:0%
otherwise,

00:19:03.260 --> 00:19:05.030 line:0%
Yun Que would lose her life.

00:19:05.570 --> 00:19:06.720 line:0%
So we

00:19:06.740 --> 00:19:08.130 line:0%
have to abide by the agreement

00:19:08.130 --> 00:19:10.080 line:0%
and dare not speak up for Jinxiu Workshop.

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:11.940 line:0%
Moreover, after all these years,

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:13.290 line:0%
those who threatened us

00:19:13.360 --> 00:19:15.290 line:0%
have never stopped monitoring us.

00:19:15.690 --> 00:19:16.750 line:0%
If that's the case,

00:19:17.640 --> 00:19:18.600 line:0%
why did the evidence

00:19:18.600 --> 00:19:20.000 line:0%
end up in Yun Que's hands?

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:21.770 line:0%
And she came alone,

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:24.380 line:0%
safe and sound, to Xiang'an to seek justice.

00:19:24.490 --> 00:19:25.360 line:0%
It was that person

00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:26.760 line:0%
who told us to do this.

00:19:26.780 --> 00:19:28.380 line:0%
We couldn't understand

00:19:28.440 --> 00:19:30.570 line:0%
why they suddenly made such a request,

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:31.760 line:0%
but

00:19:32.590 --> 00:19:34.250 line:0%
we had no choice but to comply.

00:19:34.270 --> 00:19:36.000 line:0%
We could only put on an act

00:19:36.080 --> 00:19:37.890 line:0%
to let Que know a thing or two.

00:19:37.960 --> 00:19:39.320 line:0%
With her personality,

00:19:39.350 --> 00:19:41.930 line:0%
she would definitely take those documents

00:19:42.310 --> 00:19:44.320 line:0%
and file a complaint.

00:19:45.260 --> 00:19:46.900 line:0%
The person who threatened you,

00:19:46.900 --> 00:19:47.900 line:0%
who exactly is it?

00:19:49.440 --> 00:19:50.240 line:0%
It's...

00:19:50.880 --> 00:19:51.680 line:0%
It's...

00:19:52.720 --> 00:19:54.690 line:0%
It's... it's Chen Huo'e.

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:01.580 line:0%
-Que.
-Que.

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:04.640 line:0%
So,

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:05.560 line:0%
you've known all along

00:20:05.560 --> 00:20:07.670 line:0%
that Uncle Kong's family was wrongly accused.

00:20:07.670 --> 00:20:08.850 line:0%
To protect yourselves,

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:10.120 line:0%
you knew there was more to the story,

00:20:10.120 --> 00:20:11.040 line:0%
yet you disregarded Jinxiu Workshop

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:13.230 line:0%
and the injustice done to so many people.

00:20:13.230 --> 00:20:14.290 line:0%
Que,

00:20:14.490 --> 00:20:16.900 line:0%
we had no choice.

00:20:16.960 --> 00:20:18.430 line:0%
Your mother and I

00:20:18.720 --> 00:20:21.050 line:0%
couldn't and didn't dare to risk your life

00:20:21.130 --> 00:20:23.890 line:0%
and the lives of the entire Yun family.

00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:24.870 line:0%
Father.

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:26.800 line:0%
Mother.

00:20:27.400 --> 00:20:28.680 line:0%
Then how are we, the Yun family,

00:20:28.680 --> 00:20:30.540 line:0%
any different from accomplices?

00:20:30.550 --> 00:20:32.840 line:0%
It's your father and I who were cowards.

00:20:32.950 --> 00:20:34.880 line:0%
If there's any retribution,

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:37.660 line:0%
let it fall upon us.

00:20:38.520 --> 00:20:39.320 line:0%
Que.

00:20:39.710 --> 00:20:41.650 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen and Mrs. Shen

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:44.170 line:0%
also know you're not involved in this matter.

00:20:44.170 --> 00:20:46.190 line:0%
Only by staying in the Mrs. Shen

00:20:46.250 --> 00:20:48.360 line:0%
will you be safe.

00:20:48.940 --> 00:20:51.340 line:0%
I beg for your mercy, Grand Commander Shen.

00:20:51.760 --> 00:20:52.560 line:0%
Father,

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:54.280 line:0%
Mother,

00:20:55.720 --> 00:20:57.780 line:0%
no matter what happens in the future,

00:20:58.220 --> 00:21:00.340 line:0%
I will face it together with you.

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:02.600 line:0%
Que.

00:21:31.480 --> 00:21:32.460 line:0%
So,

00:21:33.680 --> 00:21:35.280 line:0%
is the truth more important,

00:21:35.930 --> 00:21:37.160 line:0%
or the safety of those around us

00:21:37.160 --> 00:21:38.240 line:0%
more important?

00:21:39.280 --> 00:21:40.370 line:0%
I didn't expect

00:21:41.440 --> 00:21:42.700 line:0%
it's Chen Huo'e again.

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:46.880 line:0%
So she hasn't just recently come back to life,

00:21:46.880 --> 00:21:48.480 line:0%
but has been alive all along.

00:21:52.100 --> 00:21:53.360 line:0%
Over five years,

00:21:53.820 --> 00:21:54.680 line:0%
whatever Chen Huo'e

00:21:54.680 --> 00:21:55.960 line:0%
has been planning,

00:21:56.760 --> 00:21:58.640 line:0%
she must feel the time is ripe,

00:21:59.080 --> 00:21:59.880 line:0%
which is why she's using

00:21:59.880 --> 00:22:01.160 line:0%
all the evidence

00:22:01.160 --> 00:22:02.690 line:0%
to prove her resurrection.

00:22:03.390 --> 00:22:05.430 line:0%
What exactly is her purpose?

00:22:07.380 --> 00:22:09.980 line:0%
The act of deification through resurrection,

00:22:10.380 --> 00:22:11.180 line:0%
or even

00:22:12.170 --> 00:22:14.830 line:0%
a reinvestigation of the Jinxiu Workshop case.

00:22:16.040 --> 00:22:17.970 line:0%
The Jinxiu Workshop case back then

00:22:18.040 --> 00:22:20.400 line:0%
implicated the Princess Runing's mansion.

00:22:20.400 --> 00:22:21.560 line:0%
Now with a retrial,

00:22:21.580 --> 00:22:23.610 line:0%
using the moths to guide the people,

00:22:23.800 --> 00:22:24.760 line:0%
making people believe that Princess Ying

00:22:24.760 --> 00:22:26.590 line:0%
was the original instigator.

00:22:27.440 --> 00:22:28.520 line:0%
So it's...

00:22:32.540 --> 00:22:34.120 line:0%
To make the most favored member of the royal family,

00:22:34.120 --> 00:22:35.120 line:0%
Princess Ying,

00:22:35.120 --> 00:22:35.960 line:0%
be suspected,

00:22:35.960 --> 00:22:36.820 line:0%
distrusted,

00:22:36.850 --> 00:22:38.110 line:0%
or even incriminated.

00:22:41.250 --> 00:22:42.400 line:0%
If we want to investigate

00:22:42.400 --> 00:22:43.930 line:0%
the old case of Jinxiu Workshop,

00:22:43.930 --> 00:22:45.000 line:0%
it will inevitably involve

00:22:45.000 --> 00:22:46.240 line:0%
Princess Runing,

00:22:46.840 --> 00:22:47.700 line:0%
Princess Ying,

00:22:48.160 --> 00:22:48.960 line:0%
Prince Xian,

00:22:49.910 --> 00:22:51.520 line:0%
and even Prime Minister Zhang and Lai Luozhi,

00:22:51.520 --> 00:22:54.720 line:0%
the interactions between such high-ranking officials.

00:22:54.870 --> 00:22:56.720 line:0%
From the perspective of who benefits,

00:22:56.720 --> 00:22:57.480 line:0%
it is indeed difficult

00:22:57.480 --> 00:22:59.160 line:0%
not to suspect that the person behind it

00:22:59.160 --> 00:23:00.760 line:0%
is related to Princess Ying.

00:23:01.800 --> 00:23:03.730 line:0%
Chen Huo'e's deification efforts

00:23:03.810 --> 00:23:05.720 line:0%
are further guiding innocent people

00:23:05.720 --> 00:23:06.720 line:0%
to believe that

00:23:07.080 --> 00:23:07.960 line:0%
Princess Ying is the one

00:23:07.960 --> 00:23:09.560 line:0%
who needs to be punished.

00:23:15.560 --> 00:23:16.360 line:0%
What's wrong?

00:23:19.240 --> 00:23:21.520 line:0%
I now truly understand

00:23:21.990 --> 00:23:23.790 line:0%
proposing to reopen the old case

00:23:23.920 --> 00:23:25.080 line:0%
requires bearing such great

00:23:25.080 --> 00:23:26.360 line:0%
risks and pressure.

00:23:27.680 --> 00:23:29.460 line:0%
If Princess Ying is implicated,

00:23:29.460 --> 00:23:30.740 line:0%
it will involve

00:23:30.770 --> 00:23:32.450 line:0%
so many factions in the court.

00:23:34.890 --> 00:23:35.530 line:0%
Oh, right.

00:23:35.740 --> 00:23:37.000 line:0%
Pan Chi brought up another thing

00:23:37.000 --> 00:23:38.240 line:0%
on his return.

00:23:38.240 --> 00:23:39.970 line:0%
-He said...
-Grand Commander.

00:23:43.400 --> 00:23:44.080 line:0%
Princess Ying

00:23:44.080 --> 00:23:45.280 line:0%
is hosting a family banquet at her residence.

00:23:45.280 --> 00:23:46.040 line:0%
An invitation has been sent,

00:23:46.040 --> 00:23:47.300 line:0%
inviting you to attend.

00:23:47.300 --> 00:23:49.500 line:0%
I can't believe that at a time like this,

00:23:49.680 --> 00:23:50.720 line:0%
Princess Ying

00:23:50.760 --> 00:23:52.200 line:0%
still has the mood to host a family banquet.

00:23:52.200 --> 00:23:54.060 line:0%
I didn't expect it to come so soon.

00:23:55.280 --> 00:23:56.540 line:0%
Since you're curious,

00:23:57.160 --> 00:23:58.720 line:0%
why don't you accompany me?

00:24:02.050 --> 00:24:11.380 line:0%
[Wind and Rhyme]

00:24:12.520 --> 00:24:14.040 line:0%
It seems there are no

00:24:14.090 --> 00:24:15.640 line:0%
other female companions accompanying.

00:24:15.640 --> 00:24:17.170 line:0%
Then let's take this opportunity

00:24:17.170 --> 00:24:18.120 line:0%
to dispel the rumors

00:24:18.120 --> 00:24:20.580 line:0%
of our marital discord circulating in town.

00:24:21.930 --> 00:24:23.080 line:0%
That makes sense.

00:24:22.880 --> 00:24:24.210 line:0%
[Wind and Rhyme]

00:24:26.880 --> 00:24:27.840 line:0%
Then let's just

00:24:27.880 --> 00:24:29.520 line:0%
let them all see clearly.

00:24:43.690 --> 00:24:44.790 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:25:15.560 --> 00:25:16.760 line:0%
Why did Princess Ying

00:25:16.800 --> 00:25:18.800 line:0%
take your advice

00:25:18.840 --> 00:25:20.440 line:0%
to host this family banquet?

00:25:20.520 --> 00:25:21.710 line:0%
Given her personality,

00:25:21.710 --> 00:25:22.800 line:0%
she would never allow rumors

00:25:22.800 --> 00:25:23.730 line:0%
to go unchecked.

00:25:24.800 --> 00:25:27.000 line:0%
She must be making a preemptive strike,

00:25:27.100 --> 00:25:28.620 line:0%
catching the turtle in the jar.

00:25:28.620 --> 00:25:30.100 line:0%
Are you so certain

00:25:30.970 --> 00:25:33.850 line:0%
that Chen Huo'e will take action?

00:25:34.050 --> 00:25:35.080 line:0%
Chen Huo'e wants to attract

00:25:35.080 --> 00:25:36.200 line:0%
more followers.

00:25:36.450 --> 00:25:38.780 line:0%
She needs to constantly create miracles,

00:25:38.880 --> 00:25:39.880 line:0%
and punishing the real culprits

00:25:39.880 --> 00:25:41.480 line:0%
of the Jinxiu Workshop case

00:25:41.840 --> 00:25:43.560 line:0%
is her best opportunity to showcase herself

00:25:43.560 --> 00:25:45.440 line:0%
and win people's hearts.

00:25:47.040 --> 00:25:49.320 line:0%
You've always stayed away from partisan disputes.

00:25:49.320 --> 00:25:50.600 line:0%
By attending this banquet today,

00:25:50.600 --> 00:25:52.040 line:0%
aren't you afraid that others might think

00:25:52.040 --> 00:25:53.720 line:0%
you've aligned yourself with Princess Ying?

00:25:53.720 --> 00:25:55.780 line:0%
Is the White Ghost, as people call me,

00:25:55.810 --> 00:25:57.870 line:0%
someone who cares about such things?

00:26:01.320 --> 00:26:02.730 line:0%
Honey, you're brilliantly clever.

00:26:02.730 --> 00:26:04.560 line:0%
If Chen Huo'e appears later,

00:26:04.760 --> 00:26:05.960 line:0%
what do you plan to do?

00:26:07.870 --> 00:26:10.050 line:0%
I'll play it by ear.

00:26:11.620 --> 00:26:13.480 line:0%
Princess Jia'an has arrived.

00:26:15.400 --> 00:26:17.870 line:0%
Greetings, Princess Jia'an.

00:26:18.040 --> 00:26:20.620 line:0%
May Princess Jia'an be safe and well.

00:26:27.740 --> 00:26:29.220 line:0%
Greetings, Mother.

00:26:30.280 --> 00:26:31.560 line:0%
May Mother be safe and well.

00:26:31.560 --> 00:26:32.620 line:0%
Come here quickly.

00:26:38.600 --> 00:26:40.060 line:0%
Today is a family banquet.

00:26:40.440 --> 00:26:42.080 line:0%
There's no need for excessive formalities, everyone.

00:26:42.080 --> 00:26:43.320 line:0%
Please be at ease.

00:26:43.360 --> 00:26:44.360 line:0%
Please, sit down.

00:26:46.320 --> 00:26:48.760 line:0%
Princess Jia'an is truly outstanding among people.

00:26:48.760 --> 00:26:50.150 line:0%
Her bearing is extraordinary,

00:26:48.810 --> 00:26:50.770 line:0%
[Princess Jia'an]

00:26:50.280 --> 00:26:51.960 line:0%
Just as the legends say,

00:26:52.120 --> 00:26:54.040 line:0%
her demeanor is impeccable.

00:26:54.600 --> 00:26:56.640 line:0%
Princess Jia'an is indeed worthy of being the daughter of Princess Ying.

00:26:56.640 --> 00:26:57.680 line:0%
It's an honor

00:26:57.720 --> 00:26:59.240 line:0%
to meet you today.

00:26:59.280 --> 00:27:00.960 line:0%
Jia'an has been frail since childhood.

00:27:00.960 --> 00:27:03.600 line:0%
She grew up in the suburban gardens of the capital.

00:27:03.600 --> 00:27:04.730 line:0%
With me, her mother,

00:27:04.760 --> 00:27:06.440 line:0%
we've spent more time apart than together.

00:27:06.440 --> 00:27:08.440 line:0%
Not long ago, she came of age.

00:27:08.640 --> 00:27:11.000 line:0%
She was then summoned back to the capital by the Empress Dowager.

00:27:11.000 --> 00:27:12.520 line:0%
Today's banquet

00:27:12.880 --> 00:27:14.370 line:0%
is for her,

00:27:14.680 --> 00:27:16.120 line:0%
to welcome her back.

00:27:17.680 --> 00:27:19.320 line:0%
I've heard that the Grand Empress Dowager

00:27:19.320 --> 00:27:21.000 line:0%
is personally arranging a marriage

00:27:21.000 --> 00:27:22.360 line:0%
for Princess Jia'an.

00:27:22.400 --> 00:27:24.800 line:0%
Your Highness will surely find her a dragon among men.

00:27:24.800 --> 00:27:26.350 line:0%
I actually hope

00:27:26.640 --> 00:27:27.980 line:0%
she could stay by my side

00:27:28.080 --> 00:27:29.800 line:0%
for a while longer.

00:27:36.520 --> 00:27:38.000 line:0%
Have you found anything?

00:27:39.970 --> 00:27:43.010 line:0%
A glance back with a smile outshines the stars.

00:27:43.310 --> 00:27:45.190 line:0%
She's truly at a wonderful age.

00:27:56.410 --> 00:27:57.630 line:0%
Look.

00:27:57.660 --> 00:27:59.480 line:0%
With all this singing and dancing,

00:27:59.480 --> 00:28:02.110 line:0%
it's truly a feast for the eyes and heart.

00:28:02.280 --> 00:28:04.210 line:0%
Be careful, joy can turn to sorrow.

00:28:07.120 --> 00:28:09.400 line:0%
Let's hope nothing goes wrong.

00:28:41.560 --> 00:28:42.480 line:0%
The moths.

00:28:42.540 --> 00:28:43.580 line:0%
I see them.

00:28:43.610 --> 00:28:44.410 line:0%
This...

00:28:46.560 --> 00:28:47.420 line:0%
Your Highness.

00:28:50.970 --> 00:28:51.610 line:0%
Guards!

00:28:52.030 --> 00:28:52.890 line:0%
Capture her alive!

00:28:52.890 --> 00:28:53.570 line:0%
Yes!

00:29:22.350 --> 00:29:24.190 line:0%
You've painstakingly prepared the show.

00:29:24.190 --> 00:29:26.990 line:0%
Are you going to leave without seeing it yourself?

00:29:32.000 --> 00:29:33.280 line:0%
So you've discovered it.

00:29:33.280 --> 00:29:34.520 line:0%
Such a trivial trick,

00:29:35.020 --> 00:29:37.080 line:0%
and you thought you could deceive me?

00:29:37.100 --> 00:29:39.200 line:0%
Since you can control the moths,

00:29:39.580 --> 00:29:40.730 line:0%
it naturally led me here

00:29:40.730 --> 00:29:42.240 line:0%
to find you, its master.

00:29:42.330 --> 00:29:43.840 line:0%
I'll give you credit for being clever.

00:29:43.840 --> 00:29:44.520 line:0%
However,

00:29:44.650 --> 00:29:45.850 line:0%
do you think you alone

00:29:46.960 --> 00:29:48.670 line:0%
can block my path?

00:29:48.700 --> 00:29:49.500 line:0%
It's enough.

00:29:50.040 --> 00:29:52.110 line:0%
You foolish creature,

00:29:52.400 --> 00:29:53.360 line:0%
then today

00:29:54.020 --> 00:29:55.600 line:0%
I'll leave you

00:29:55.680 --> 00:29:57.270 line:0%
with no way out.

00:29:58.150 --> 00:29:59.790 line:0%
If you don't align with me,

00:30:00.110 --> 00:30:02.570 line:0%
you'll be walking into a perilous situation

00:30:02.920 --> 00:30:04.520 line:0%
with no way out.

00:30:05.210 --> 00:30:07.170 line:0%
The unjust case of the Shen family back then,

00:30:07.170 --> 00:30:09.170 line:0%
does it have anything to do with you?

00:30:10.160 --> 00:30:11.160 line:0%
Your father

00:30:11.200 --> 00:30:13.070 line:0%
was nothing but an ant.

00:30:13.640 --> 00:30:15.990 line:0%
Even if he died, no one would care.

00:30:16.960 --> 00:30:17.960 line:0%
Why don't

00:30:18.430 --> 00:30:19.740 line:0%
you believe me

00:30:20.050 --> 00:30:22.260 line:0%
and beg me to resurrect him?

00:30:22.350 --> 00:30:24.120 line:0%
Smooth talk

00:30:24.380 --> 00:30:25.660 line:0%
and nonsense.

00:30:25.680 --> 00:30:26.960 line:0%
The person who framed your father

00:30:26.960 --> 00:30:28.160 line:0%
is right by your side.

00:30:28.480 --> 00:30:29.740 line:0%
Yet you mistake the culprit for your father,

00:30:29.740 --> 00:30:31.240 line:0%
aiding the tyrant in his cruelty.

00:30:31.240 --> 00:30:32.850 line:0%
Shen Du, oh Shen Du,

00:30:33.550 --> 00:30:36.990 line:0%
your father can't rest in peace.

00:30:37.010 --> 00:30:38.410 line:0%
You're asking for death.

00:31:45.360 --> 00:31:47.050 line:0%
Can people who come back from the dead

00:31:47.050 --> 00:31:48.380 line:0%
really bleed?

00:31:48.940 --> 00:31:51.000 line:0%
I've never believed that in this world

00:31:51.000 --> 00:31:53.730 line:0%
there could be people who come back from the dead.

00:31:55.340 --> 00:31:56.550 line:0%
Kill me,

00:31:56.720 --> 00:31:58.440 line:0%
and you'll lose another person who knows

00:31:58.440 --> 00:32:01.500 line:0%
about the unjust case of the Shen family from back then.

00:32:09.880 --> 00:32:11.530 line:0%
Xing, be careful!

00:32:17.280 --> 00:32:18.230 line:0%
Xing!

00:32:20.410 --> 00:32:21.460 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:32:21.840 --> 00:32:22.770 line:0%
Are you alright?

00:32:22.840 --> 00:32:23.680 line:0%
I know now

00:32:23.700 --> 00:32:25.830 line:0%
the key to Chen Huo'e's resurrection.

00:32:28.400 --> 00:32:29.200 line:0%
Let's go.

00:32:31.460 --> 00:32:34.150 line:0%
[Wind and Rhyme]

00:32:36.890 --> 00:32:37.750 line:0%
Your Highness,

00:32:38.480 --> 00:32:40.120 line:0%
Princess Jia'an has been frightened

00:32:40.120 --> 00:32:42.080 line:0%
and has taken a calming pill to rest.

00:32:42.080 --> 00:32:42.880 line:0%
Good.

00:32:48.880 --> 00:32:49.920 line:0%
Your Highness.

00:32:50.000 --> 00:32:51.410 line:0%
The assailant has been caught.

00:32:51.410 --> 00:32:52.610 line:0%
Your Grand Commander

00:32:55.800 --> 00:32:57.450 line:0%
indeed keeps his word.

00:33:08.630 --> 00:33:10.150 line:0%
Who sent you here?

00:33:10.530 --> 00:33:11.770 line:0%
No one.

00:33:11.790 --> 00:33:13.020 line:0%
Drag her out.

00:33:13.150 --> 00:33:14.520 line:0%
Beat her until she talks.

00:33:14.520 --> 00:33:15.200 line:0%
Yes.

00:33:20.680 --> 00:33:22.680 line:0%
You've all seen it today.

00:33:22.840 --> 00:33:24.350 line:0%
This so-called Fire Moth Sect,

00:33:24.350 --> 00:33:26.350 line:0%
this so-called boundless miracle,

00:33:26.640 --> 00:33:28.660 line:0%
is nothing but a group of people fooling the public,

00:33:28.660 --> 00:33:29.520 line:0%
deceiving the world,

00:33:29.520 --> 00:33:31.040 line:0%
mere charlatans.

00:33:31.480 --> 00:33:32.620 line:0%
From now on,

00:33:32.760 --> 00:33:33.560 line:0%
if anyone

00:33:33.560 --> 00:33:35.160 line:0%
uses Chen Huo'e's name again

00:33:35.160 --> 00:33:36.560 line:0%
to spread rumors,

00:33:37.920 --> 00:33:39.700 line:0%
this will be their fate.

00:33:40.240 --> 00:33:41.040 line:0%
Yes.

00:34:00.150 --> 00:34:01.880 line:0%
How could you be so careless?

00:34:08.880 --> 00:34:09.689 line:0%
It was...

00:34:09.749 --> 00:34:10.860 line:0%
It was Shen Du.

00:34:11.420 --> 00:34:12.680 line:0%
And Yan Xing.

00:34:13.070 --> 00:34:14.800 line:0%
They ruined my plans.

00:34:16.090 --> 00:34:17.450 line:0%
After today,

00:34:18.920 --> 00:34:21.920 line:0%
I'm afraid it will be difficult to have another chance

00:34:22.340 --> 00:34:24.600 line:0%
to get close to Princess Ying's Mansion.

00:34:24.910 --> 00:34:27.110 line:0%
I will do anything to eliminate enemies

00:34:27.240 --> 00:34:28.400 line:0%
for my master.

00:34:29.979 --> 00:34:31.010 line:0%
Forget it.

00:34:32.420 --> 00:34:34.019 line:0%
Bringing down Princess Ying

00:34:35.030 --> 00:34:37.490 line:0%
is not something that can be done overnight.

00:34:38.860 --> 00:34:41.030 line:0%
You fell into Shen Du's trap.

00:34:41.110 --> 00:34:42.910 line:0%
He wanted you to make a move.

00:34:43.080 --> 00:34:44.760 line:0%
As long as you can't fulfill the prophecy

00:34:44.760 --> 00:34:45.760 line:0%
and punish Princess Ying,

00:34:45.760 --> 00:34:47.220 line:0%
they will use it against you.

00:34:47.220 --> 00:34:49.600 line:0%
You'll lose the trust of your disciples and the people.

00:34:49.600 --> 00:34:50.280 line:0%
No.

00:34:51.130 --> 00:34:53.150 line:0%
I won't let Shen Du succeed.

00:34:53.280 --> 00:34:54.700 line:0%
Those who offend the Fire Moth

00:34:54.700 --> 00:34:56.170 line:0%
must all die.

00:35:00.440 --> 00:35:01.550 line:0%
Very good.

00:35:03.140 --> 00:35:04.800 line:0%
Then go and demonstrate

00:35:04.840 --> 00:35:07.000 line:0%
your miracle of rebirth again.

00:35:30.720 --> 00:35:31.520 line:0%
Don't move.

00:35:35.440 --> 00:35:37.600 line:0%
Next time we encounter Chen Huo'e,

00:35:38.290 --> 00:35:39.950 line:0%
we won't let her escape again.

00:35:44.000 --> 00:35:46.060 line:0%
You still want there to be a next time?

00:35:48.800 --> 00:35:49.800 line:0%
Now that she no longer has

00:35:49.800 --> 00:35:51.330 line:0%
the secret of immortality,

00:35:51.740 --> 00:35:53.430 line:0%
with your skills, capturing her

00:35:53.430 --> 00:35:54.860 line:0%
should be easy.

00:35:59.400 --> 00:36:00.430 line:0%
So,

00:36:01.900 --> 00:36:03.740 line:0%
it was Pan Chi who brought the news

00:36:03.740 --> 00:36:04.560 line:0%
that among the people

00:36:04.560 --> 00:36:06.040 line:0%
the Fire Moth Sect killed,

00:36:06.400 --> 00:36:08.130 line:0%
there was an old miracle doctor

00:36:08.280 --> 00:36:09.840 line:0%
who mentioned that he had treated someone

00:36:09.840 --> 00:36:11.240 line:0%
with transposed organs.

00:36:47.810 --> 00:36:49.610 line:0%
Based on just this one sentence,

00:36:49.750 --> 00:36:51.030 line:0%
you deduced that

00:36:51.290 --> 00:36:52.360 line:0%
Chen Huo'e's heart

00:36:52.360 --> 00:36:53.510 line:0%
is different from normal people's,

00:36:53.510 --> 00:36:54.640 line:0%
not on the left side.

00:36:55.300 --> 00:36:57.370 line:0%
I wasn't sure before,

00:36:58.220 --> 00:36:59.940 line:0%
but during our encounter,

00:37:00.040 --> 00:37:01.350 line:0%
I confirmed it.

00:37:01.440 --> 00:37:03.400 line:0%
Her heartbeat is on the right side.

00:37:04.800 --> 00:37:05.800 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:37:06.000 --> 00:37:06.800 line:0%
Come in.

00:37:08.270 --> 00:37:09.320 line:0%
The guards watching the Fire Moth Sect disciples

00:37:09.320 --> 00:37:10.160 line:0%
have reported

00:37:10.240 --> 00:37:11.080 line:0%
some unusual activity.

00:37:11.080 --> 00:37:12.280 line:0%
What's the situation?

00:37:12.280 --> 00:37:13.160 line:0%
This morning, Chen Huo'e

00:37:13.160 --> 00:37:14.480 line:0%
appeared separately in the east,

00:37:14.480 --> 00:37:16.440 line:0%
west, south, and north of the city.

00:37:16.480 --> 00:37:18.000 line:0%
She claimed that the Fire Moth Sect has great supernatural powers,

00:37:18.000 --> 00:37:19.560 line:0%
not only can they bring people back from the dead,

00:37:19.560 --> 00:37:21.160 line:0%
but also create multiple incarnations.

00:37:21.160 --> 00:37:21.960 line:0%
In no time,

00:37:22.000 --> 00:37:23.240 line:0%
in the homes of Xiang'an City's residents,

00:37:23.240 --> 00:37:23.800 line:0%
they all started worshipping

00:37:23.800 --> 00:37:25.080 line:0%
various types of fire moths.

00:37:25.080 --> 00:37:27.440 line:0%
It seems the ambition of this Fire Moth Sect

00:37:27.440 --> 00:37:29.700 line:0%
is not limited to just within their sect.

00:37:40.990 --> 00:37:42.990 line:0%
[Cautiousness and Leniency]

00:37:42.120 --> 00:37:43.250 line:0%
Send out the notice.

00:37:43.640 --> 00:37:45.770 line:0%
Search the entire city for Chen Huo'e.

00:37:45.960 --> 00:37:46.760 line:0%
Yes, sir.

00:37:53.650 --> 00:37:57.040 line:0%
[Cautiousness and Leniency]

00:37:57.960 --> 00:37:59.290 line:0%
Keep an eye on the madam.

00:37:59.330 --> 00:38:01.390 line:0%
Don't let her wander around anymore.

00:38:01.480 --> 00:38:02.280 line:0%
Understood.

00:38:15.140 --> 00:38:17.220 line:0%
-Let me go!
-Let me go!

00:38:17.240 --> 00:38:17.960 line:0%
Let go of me!

00:38:21.130 --> 00:38:22.520 line:0%
Take them all to the dungeon.

00:38:22.520 --> 00:38:23.320 line:0%
Yes, sir.

00:38:26.140 --> 00:38:28.630 line:0%
Grand Commander, bad news!

00:38:31.240 --> 00:38:32.240 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:38:32.460 --> 00:38:34.050 line:0%
Madam is missing.

00:38:34.120 --> 00:38:35.040 line:0%
Missing?

00:38:35.900 --> 00:38:37.160 line:0%
Outside the Shen's Mansion,

00:38:37.160 --> 00:38:38.760 line:0%
those Fire Moth Sect thugs

00:38:38.780 --> 00:38:40.380 line:0%
are causing harm and chaos.

00:38:40.520 --> 00:38:41.320 line:0%
Saving people is the priority.

00:38:41.320 --> 00:38:42.170 line:0%
Open the gate.

00:38:42.240 --> 00:38:44.180 line:0%
The Grand Commander instructed before he left

00:38:44.180 --> 00:38:45.670 line:0%
that before his return,

00:38:45.700 --> 00:38:48.120 line:0%
the gates of the Shen's Mansion must not be opened under any circumstances.

00:38:48.120 --> 00:38:49.520 line:0%
If today, any common people

00:38:49.520 --> 00:38:50.700 line:0%
outside the Grand Commander's Mansion

00:38:50.700 --> 00:38:51.770 line:0%
meet with misfortune,

00:38:51.770 --> 00:38:52.880 line:0%
it would implicate the Grand Commander

00:38:52.880 --> 00:38:53.920 line:0%
in being unkind and unjust.

00:38:53.920 --> 00:38:54.680 line:0%
In the future, these gates

00:38:54.680 --> 00:38:56.340 line:0%
might truly never open again.

00:38:57.440 --> 00:38:58.240 line:0%
Open the door.

00:38:58.360 --> 00:38:59.160 line:0%
Save them.

00:39:01.130 --> 00:39:01.450 line:0%
[Shen's Mansion]

00:39:11.730 --> 00:39:13.520 line:0%
Madam and I went to rescue people.

00:39:13.520 --> 00:39:15.280 line:0%
We didn't expect to fall into their ambush.

00:39:15.280 --> 00:39:16.380 line:0%
In the blink of an eye,

00:39:16.380 --> 00:39:18.450 line:0%
Madam disappeared without a trace.

00:39:18.710 --> 00:39:19.810 line:0%
Let's go find her.

00:39:20.800 --> 00:39:21.600 line:0%
Let's go.

00:39:28.240 --> 00:39:30.030 line:0%
Moths to a flame.

00:39:30.060 --> 00:39:32.080 line:0%
Born at dawn, dead by dusk.

00:39:32.100 --> 00:39:34.220 line:0%
Moths to a flame.

00:39:34.250 --> 00:39:36.690 line:0%
Born at dawn, dead by dusk.

