Born at dawn, dead by dusk.

00:39:45.320 --> 00:39:46.280 line:0%
The moth has been resurrected.

00:39:46.280 --> 00:39:47.480 line:0%
The moth has shown its spirit.

00:39:47.480 --> 00:39:48.710 line:0%
The moth has shown its spirit.

00:39:48.710 --> 00:39:51.010 line:0%
The moth has shown its spirit.

00:39:52.440 --> 00:39:54.000 line:0%
The moth has shown its spirit.

